==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|за-|глуши́ть}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|заглуши́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Rominf-заглушить.wav}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|заглуши́ть|pf|impf=глуши́ть,заглуша́ть}}

# to [[muffle]], to [[deafen]], to [[damp]], to [[drown]], to [[jam]]
# ''(pain etc)'' to [[alleviate]], to [[soothe]], to [[dull]]
# ''(plants)'' to [[choke]] ''(up)''
#: {{uxi|ru|[[сорняк|сорняки́]] '''заглуши́ли''' [[огоро́д]]|the kitchen garden is choked up with weeds}}
# to [[suppress]], to [[stifle]], to [[smother]]
#* {{quote-book|ru|year=1905|author=w:ru:Фёдор Сологуб<t:{{w|Fyodor Sologub}}>
|title=w:ru:Мелкий бес|chapter=XV|location=|publisher=|newversion=English translation from|translator2=John Cournos and Richard Aldington|title2=w:en:[[The Petty Demon|The Little Demon]]|location2=New York|publisher2=w:en:Alfred A. Knopf|year2=1916|page2=|pageurl2=
|text=Ми́ша, обня́в её у по́яса и прижима́ясь к ней голово́ю, хохота́л, сотряса́ясь от хо́хота и от стара́ния '''заглуши́ть''' его́.|t=Misha, catching her by the waist, with his head against her, laughed and shook with his efforts '''to suppress''' his laughter.}}
# to [[stop]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''заглуши́ть''' [[мото́р]]|to stop/stall the engine}}

